# --- Corpus ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Real sourced documents are large, re-downloadable and often copyrighted, so
# they stay out of the repo. The synthetic Northwind samples are the opposite:
# they are ground-truth fixtures for the Phase 4 evaluation harness, so a clone
# must get them.
data/documents/*
data/tabular/*
!data/**/.gitkeep
!data/documents/sample_*.md
!data/documents/sample_*.pdf

.ipynb_checkpoints/
